<codeline><highlight class="normal">data<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>performed<sp/>in<sp/>one<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>DMA<sp/>channels&apos;<sp/>ISRs.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
